|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: ws1.ws_order_number = ws2.ws_order_number AND ws1.ws_warehouse_sk != ws2.ws_warehouse_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
