|               |                   TableScan: web_sales                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |     SubqueryAlias: ws1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       TableScan: web_sales projection=[ws_ship_date_sk, ws_ship_addr_sk, ws_web_site_sk, ws_order_number, ws_ext_ship_cost, ws_net_profit]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
